---

<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<meta name="description" content="Zaviren implementa IA soberana con RAG para tu empresa: tus datos, bajo tu control. Muy pronto." />
		<title>Zaviren — Muy pronto</title>
		<style>
			:root {
				--bg: #0a0b0f;
				--bg-glow: #12142099;
				--blue: #3b82f6;
				--purple: #8b5cf6;
				--text: #f5f6f8;
				--muted: #9a9dab;
				--border: #ffffff1a;
			}

			* {
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}

			html,
			body {
				height: 100%;
				margin: 0;
			}

			body {
				background:
					radial-gradient(60% 50% at 80% 0%, #2c2a5a4d 0%, transparent 60%),
					radial-gradient(50% 40% at 10% 100%, #1e3a8a4d 0%, transparent 60%),
					var(--bg);
				color: var(--text);
				font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
				min-height: 100%;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: space-between;
				padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem;
			}

			.logo {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.6rem;
			}

			.logo-mark {
				width: 28px;
				height: 28px;
			}

			.logo-word {
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				letter-spacing: 0.28em;
			}

			main {
				flex: 1;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				text-align: center;
				max-width: 640px;
				gap: 1.5rem;
			}

			.eyebrow {
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				letter-spacing: 0.25em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: var(--blue);
			}

			h1 {
				font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 6vw, 3.75rem);
				font-weight: 800;
				line-height: 1.1;
				margin: 0;
			}

			.gradient {
				background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue), var(--purple));
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				background-clip: text;
				color: transparent;
			}

			p.subtitle {
				font-size: 1.05rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
				color: var(--muted);
				margin: 0;
			}

			.cta {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.5rem;
				margin-top: 0.75rem;
				padding: 0.85rem 1.75rem;
				border-radius: 999px;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				font-weight: 700;
				color: #fff;
				text-decoration: none;
				background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--blue), var(--purple));
				box-shadow: 0 8px 30px -8px #3b82f680;
			}

			.cta:hover {
				filter: brightness(1.08);
			}

			.badges {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 0.6rem;
				justify-content: center;
				margin-top: 0.75rem;
			}

			.badge {
				border: 1px solid var(--border);
				border-radius: 999px;
				padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				color: var(--text);
				background: #ffffff08;
			}

			footer {
				width: 100%;
				max-width: 640px;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.5rem;
				text-align: center;
				border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
				padding-top: 1.25rem;
				font-size: 0.8rem;
				color: var(--muted);
			}

			footer a {
				color: var(--blue);
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			footer a:hover {
				text-decoration: underline;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="logo">
			<img class="logo-mark" src="/favicon.svg" alt="Zaviren" width="28" height="21" />
			<span class="logo-word">ZAVIREN</span>
		</div>

		<main>
			<span class="eyebrow">Muy pronto</span>
			<h1>IA soberana, <span class="gradient">bajo tu control</span>.</h1>
			<p class="subtitle">
				Zaviren implementa IA que trabaja sobre tus documentos, dentro de tu perímetro,
				sin que tu información salga a la nube de un tercero.
			</p>
			<a class="cta" href="mailto:contact@zaviren.com?subject=Quiero%20saber%20m%C3%A1s%20de%20Zaviren">
				Avísame cuando esté listo
			</a>
			<div class="badges">
				<span class="badge">Soberano</span>
				<span class="badge">Verificable</span>
				<span class="badge">A tu ritmo</span>
			</div>
		</main>

		<footer>
			<span>© 2026 Zaviren · <a href="https://www.zaviren.com">www.zaviren.com</a></span>
			<span>Tus datos no se comparten con terceros</span>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>
